    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into the Woolderness is a game in which you will shepherd your flock through the fae wilds and encounter wily pucas, haughty fae, and grass that gives your sheep\u2019s wool magical properties. Spin yarn and craft powerful sweaters to enhance your dogs\u2019 abilities as you make a life for yourself in this mysterious land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/6c5e53ac3b8bb358a855cf06df578333.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Explore the Woolderness and experience a chaotic mix of fae and magic world effects. Whilst emBARKing on your adventure, you will learn how to identify various magic grasses. Grasses such as sweet grass, crab grass, blue grass, tall grass, and many more! Each of these grasses will then imbue your sheep's wool with different abilities. Abilities will transfer into your sweaters when crafted in our RHYTHM KNITTING GAME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/e4626cc4971a2c36e0e7e76899133f17.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into your own funky flow while crafting. Knit to the beat and don't drop a stitch or else you'll be handing out holey gifts to your furry companions. Pick and choose different skeins of wool in order to craft the most POWERFUL SWEATERS KNOWN TO FAIRY KIND.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/e609efa9e93a6902439d5d6d322641b4.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Knit your way towards unravelling the secrets of the forest! Why did the pucas start stealing wool? What's causing the world to get colder? And which outfit will my dog like the most?! Are ewe up for the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into the Woolderness is a game in which you will shepherd your flock through the fae wilds and encounter wily pucas, haughty fae, and grass that gives your sheep\u2019s wool magical properties. Spin yarn and craft powerful sweaters to enhance your dogs\u2019 abilities as you make a life for yourself in this mysterious land.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/6c5e53ac3b8bb358a855cf06df578333.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Explore the Woolderness and experience a chaotic mix of fae and magic world effects. Whilst emBARKing on your adventure, you will learn how to identify various magic grasses. Grasses such as sweet grass, crab grass, blue grass, tall grass, and many more! Each of these grasses will then imbue your sheep's wool with different abilities. Abilities will transfer into your sweaters when crafted in our RHYTHM KNITTING GAME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/e4626cc4971a2c36e0e7e76899133f17.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into your own funky flow while crafting. Knit to the beat and don't drop a stitch or else you'll be handing out holey gifts to your furry companions. Pick and choose different skeins of wool in order to craft the most POWERFUL SWEATERS KNOWN TO FAIRY KIND.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434870/extras/e609efa9e93a6902439d5d6d322641b4.avif?t=1752006467\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Knit your way towards unravelling the secrets of the forest! Why did the pucas start stealing wool? What's causing the world to get colder? And which outfit will my dog like the most?! Are ewe up for the challenge?</p>",
    "short_description": "Fairies riding dogs wearing sweaters! Into the Woolderness lets you run through the mystical fae wilds and shepherd your flock against the wily Pookas that seek to take your wool! Solve puzzles and defend your flock with your dog companions so that you can eventually reward them with sweaters!",
